{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to start playing. The game is loading. BOOM... glitches everywhere, assets couldn't load properly, and even the controls are messed up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, somehow the game is still letting you play. Now you have to find your way through the glitchy world of Sequence Jump, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controls are restricted: Aside from movement, you only have one button that is working. But still, you have to use different abilities. How? Your action button is constantly re-wired, either by the game, or by yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >List of Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Sequence Mechanic. <i>Special!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth &amp; Realistic Physics. <i>Expressive!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitchy Visuals. <i>Quirky!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant Action. <i>Unhindered!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-Aware Meta-Game. <i>Eerie!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Feature Every Level. <i>Nice!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls, Deep Gameplay. <i>Complex!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergizing Abilities. <i>Extreme!</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860610?t=1757273238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860610?t=1757273238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860610/2b3ca64de45187044e087e39dd9f8e7756df520e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757273238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860610/2b3ca64de45187044e087e39dd9f8e7756df520e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757273238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3860720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to start playing. The game is loading. BOOM... glitches everywhere, assets couldn't load properly, and even the controls are messed up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, somehow the game is still letting you play. Now you have to find your way through the glitchy world of Sequence Jump, where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your controls are restricted: Aside from movement, you only have one button that is working. But still, you have to use different abilities. How? Your action button is constantly re-wired, either by the game, or by yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >List of Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Sequence Mechanic. <i>Special!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth &amp; Realistic Physics. <i>Expressive!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitchy Visuals. <i>Quirky!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant Action. <i>Unhindered!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-Aware Meta-Game. <i>Eerie!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Feature Every Level. <i>Nice!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls, Deep Gameplay. <i>Complex!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergizing Abilities. <i>Extreme!</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sagewing Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860610/37bd91c770d9515e2c2c1c43b3fc036726095c2f/header.jpg?t=1757273238","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3860610/1609636443/d49e94